  },
  "Gently return to the stretch.": {
    "src": "/audio/130ba5a96b93c561.mp3",
    "duration": 2.402667
  },
  "Allow the weight of your arms to provide a gentle stretch. Do not press down.": {
    "src": "/audio/9db8a4ed99b8715b.mp3",
    "duration": 5.354667
  },
  "Bring your ear to your shoulder. Rest your hand on the side of your head and allow the weight of your arm to gently pull, stretching the side of your neck.": {
